const description: { en: string; ja: string } = {"en":"Six lozenges meet at the middle and make a six-pointed star, with points to the left and right. A small lozenge stands beyond each point. Over each notch of the star stands a jagged leaf: a round body with six pointed teeth, three on each side of its axis, and a foot that narrows down into the notch. Each tooth is two equal bowed arcs from the body to a point. The six leaves, the six lozenges and the six small lozenges are each one unit turned a sixth of a turn at a time.","ja":"六つの菱を中央で合わせて、左右に先の向く六つの角の星を作ります。それぞれの角の先に、小さな菱を一つ置きます。星のへこみごとに、ぎざぎざの葉を一枚立てます。葉は、丸い胴に、軸の左右三つずつ、六つのとがった歯をつけ、根元はへこみに向かって細くします。歯はどれも、胴から先までを同じ二本の弧で描きます。六枚の葉、六つの菱、六つの小さな菱は、それぞれ一つを作って6分の1回転ずつ回します。"};

